window.products.push({"id":653002,"name":"Tumbler Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Cup With Lid |16 oz Travel Coffee Mug |Go Tumbler for Home, Office, Outdoor, Traveling for Men, Women|Metal T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E+cXjJBXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Take Your Hot or Cold drinks To Go With Our Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler! This Vacuum Insulated Travel Mug more cost effective, compared with other cups in terms of quality and price. The tumbler cup is made of 18/8 stainless steel double wall vacuum insulation and BPA -free material, which would keep drinks icy cold for up to 24 hours and hot drinks hot for up to 6 hours. The attractive coated and the compact shape fits into your hand and all standard cup holders. Leak-proof design prevents the drinks from spilling. Air vent on the mouth piece allows beverages to flow out smoothly, without gushing or overflowing. Features: *Convenient carry size *Ideal for day pack *Double Wall Vacuum Insulated *Keeps Hot up to 6 Hours, Keeps Cold up to 24 Hours *BPA-Free, 18/8 Stainless Steel *Lifetime Warranty Warnings: - Do not pack dry ice and carbonated drinks. - Do not use a microwave machine, induction cooker or open flame to heat the product. - Do not use dishwashers, dryers, etc. for cleaning and drying. - Do not use for long-term insulation of dairy products or baby foods (risk of bacterial reproduction). - Not recommended for use by children: Keep out of the reach of children, especially when product contains hot contents, which may burn or scald user. - Please place it properly to avoid accidents involving infants and young children. - Do not touch heat sources such as open flames and heaters, and damage the product to affect normal use.-When placed in a bag, keep the cap closed and in an upright position to avoid leakage. -When pour some hot coffee or water, please wait 2-3 minutes then close the drinking hole since the flip-up lid might be come off influenced by pressure.  - After use, please clean and dry immediately to avoid odor caused by liquididue deterioration. Please read the instructions before you use it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E+cXjJBXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUBILCUIS","source_asin":"B07Y9SGNBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9SGNBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9SGNBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
