window.products.push({"id":653046,"name":"Vekkia Bed Bridge Twin to King Bed Converter Kit - Sturdy Bed Gap Filler for Split King Adjustable, Mattress Bed Connector with Washable Cover for Gue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516d6cqP-WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Patent Structure Of Bed Gap Filling System - Providing you enough support and premium comfortable feeling. After several tests, this twin bed connector perfectly support the weight of a standing woman, meaning you, your kids & your small pets can safely sleep in the middle of your new combined bed. It works for Twin, Twin XL, Full, Full XL, Queen-Size mattresses. No More Gaps, Bumps, Bulges With Softness And Comfort Only - Bed bridge pad is made of high thickened density sponge, 10'' wide & 75'' long \"T\" wedge offers stability over the gap and premium comfort. Stopping the air flow and prevents you from complaining that you've fallen into a crack. Creating A Single, Uniform Bed - The bed connector is perfect for couples who may sleep like a rock on a soft, cloud-like mattress while their partner may get heavenly sleep on a mattress as hard as stone. Two completely different mattress types can be placed together by using the vekkia bed bridge, a single uniform bed is created that gives each person the comfort they need without separating them. Bigger Bed In An Instant - This bed maker kit fully fills gaps between twin or twin XL beds and acts as a twin to king bed bridge. The V-Shaped foam wedge provides natural support and evenly distributes weight ensure your can get proper quality rest at night and not wake up feeling fatigue. Getting A King-Size Mattress Pad With A Little Money- By filling the unwanted gap in the middle, pushing the two twin mattresses together, and then covered with your sheets, pads and toppers, you can get a seamless king-size mattress in minutes. Innerspring mattresses, air mattresses and water beds, bed mattress bridges can aslso be placed directly on the mattress. Cheaper than purchasing a king-size mattress. Detachable Bed Gap Filler - The cushion cover is removable with zipper design and non-pilling, easy to put on and take off for change & machine washable. Perfect for guest rooms, B&Bs, guesthouses and vacation rentals. Comes with a transparent bag for easy storage until needed. USING WITH ADJUSTABLE BEDS : Works only if the beds are in same or similar positions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516d6cqP-WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vekkia","source_asin":"B0B6NRN85K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6NRN85K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6NRN85K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
