window.products.push({"id":653100,"name":"Dreamfarm Supoon | Non-Stick Silicone Sit Up Scraping & Cooking Spoon with Measuring Lines I Classic Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u74+ZvbwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STIR, SCRAPE, AND SERVE | Supoon is the world’s best cooking spoon! With its flat silicone tip, deep scooping head, and flexible squeegee sides, you can scrape your pan or bowl clean, leaving nothing behind and even less to clean up MEASURES UP | Comes with 15ml tablespoon and 5ml teaspoon measurement lines. Now you can scrape, measure, stir, mix, scoop, and serve using one silicone spoon. With all these incredible features, the Supoon measures up to its name! COUNTER STAYS CLEAN | The non-stick spoon that doesn't mess around! The clever handle design means you don’t need a spoon rest. With the Supoon’s head raised off your counter, your kitchen counter stays clean and the Supoon stays hygienic HANDLES THE HEAT | Stay cool when things heat up in the kitchen! The Supoon is safe to use on non-stick cookware thanks to its silicone tip which is heat-resistant to 260°C / 500°F. It’s also dishwasher safe DESIGNED IN AUSTRALIA | Dreamfarm is an Australian owned company, and every Dreamfarm product is proudly designed in sunny Brisbane, Australia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u74+ZvbwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamfarm","source_asin":"B08J7G27QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J7G27QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J7G27QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":653101,"name":"Ginger Cottages - K-9 Doghouse - Retriever K9105","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UB3LGLqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ginger Cottages K9 Cottage - Retriever is a wonderful and unique addition to the Ginger Cottages collection. It is a delightful dog house that is just made for Retrievers. Of course, there is a red fireplug on the side to make any Retriever feel welcome. Each doghouse has a small hole on its underside designed to allow a small light to be inserted. Upon lighting your cottage, you’ll immediately discover the first secret—a little scene inside each and every one. * This dog has lost its frisbee. Do you see where it landed? * There is a duck decoy somewhere on this cottage... do you know why? * Can you find the pawprint, chew knot, and T-bone steak? * Can you find all 17 bones?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UB3LGLqvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginger Cottages","source_asin":"B01CT5PEPE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CT5PEPE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CT5PEPE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
