window.products.push({"id":653229,"name":"Furologee TV Stand for 60 65 inch TV, Long 55\" Entertainment Center TV Console, TV Table with 3-Tier Open Storage Shelves, Industrial TV Cabinet with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71grR6VJwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[2-Tier Mesh Shelves] TV cabinet with 2 tiers open mesh shelves and wood top, perfect for your cable box, DVD, TV box, XBOX or other entertainment accessories, good for heat dissipation. You can watch movies and play games as you like. Definitely a great value for the price. [Adapt to TVs up to 65 inches] Overall dimensions of the long TV stand is 55.00” Long x 15.75” Deep x 19.88” Tall.This TV stand can accommodate flat curved screens up to 65\" (including 60\", 55\", 43\", 32\", etc. ). There is 7-8\" of space between each tier, allowing you to place bulky items. Table top holds up to 140 lbs, each mesh shelf can hold up to 25 lbs. [Charming Industrial Style] This retro television stand is crafted from high-grade MDF with a durable laminated finish and a rich textured surface. The wood finish blends well with other wood textures and neutral interiors. The inverted V-shaped construction on the sides enhances the aesthetic and provides extra stability. It would fit any style from industrial to mid-century modern to minimalist. [Multifunctional TV Stand]:​​The simple and retro style adds elegant charm to your room, perfectly matched with different styles of furniture. This TV table is suitable for living room, bedroom and other different rooms to place your DVD, speaker, remote control, books, vase or anything you like. Equipped with adjustable feet, it is not easy to scratch the floor and is suitable for uneven ground. [Easy to assemble] Easy to follow includes instructions and great online assembly video! The instruction manual has detailed operating instructions, including hardware and tools, and each accessory is labeled for easy installation. We provide customer service before and after purchase. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71grR6VJwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furologee","source_asin":"B0B87RTMFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87RTMFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87RTMFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
