window.products.push({"id":653286,"name":"GladWare Home Mini Round Food Storage Containers, Small Food Containers Hold 4 Ounces of Food, 8 Count Set | With Glad Lock Tight Seal, BPA Free Conta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815My2Vbs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Glad knows that the kitchen is the heart of your home. It's where your kids create their favorite crafts, where you whip up your favorite meal, and where memories are made. The kitchen, however, can also be prime real estate for chaos! Glad is dedicated to minimizing mess so you can get back to connecting with your family. GladWare is a worry-free way to store and transport feasts and snacks alike. BPA-free food storage containers are microwave and dishwasher safe. Make your house as stylish as you are with the GladWare Home Collection. These chic containers are extra sturdy to shield your food from air and lock in freshness. The metallic copper lid easily snaps on to create a tight seal and prevent messy spills. When you use Glad, you know your food is receiving quality protection. Food storage containers tupperware sets with lids plastic containers with lids are perfect food storage containers with lids airtight plastic containers plastic food containers with lids food storage containers with lids tupperware sets. GLadware glad storage containers with lids glad containers. Ziplock containers with lids snack containers glad storage containers plastic food storage containers with lids. Plastic containers for food storage and plastic food storage containers. Containers for food storage with lids 2 cup storage containers with lids. 9 oz containers 9 oz plastic containers bronze glad plastic food containers food storage container glad food tupperware. YOUR SATISFACTION IS OUR PRIORITY: If you have any questions or feedback on this product, please reach out to us at Brand Buzz CP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815My2Vbs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glad","source_asin":"B09GTN7WNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GTN7WNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GTN7WNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":653287,"name":"Chef Knife, Super Sharp 7.5 inch Professional Chef's Knife with Pakkawood Handle, VG-5 Stainless Steel, Kitchen Meat Vegetable Knife with Leather Shea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6154iY5VfiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Professional 7.5 Inches Chef Knife;chef's knife is probably the most popular tool in any kitchen owing to its multi-purpose qualities. Regardless of what you are dealing with,a salad with four to eleven ingredients, pork bones, fish, lamb or poultry,you will be able to manage both delicate slicing and hard-core chopping. Ultra-sharp Kitchen Knife;The core layer of the blade is VG-5, high carbon molybdenum vanadium steel. VG-5 steel belongs to the V-Gold group of steel which means that it is extremely hard and corrosion-resistant . It is durable, as well as easy to sharpen and care for and has an unprecedented hardness of approximately 58 HRC. The beveled edge is sharpened by hand at a 14-15˚ angle and features an incredible mirror polish finish with perfect balance between sharpness and strength. BLADE FINISH;The knife bears visible impressions of the hand-forging process (round hammer dents on the blade), which gives it a beautiful finish and also prevents food from sticking to the blade. This blade finish is also called tsuchime. Because there is less surface that is in contact with food, there is also less friction and, consequently, less force is needed for cutting. The outer layers have a matte finish and that give the chef knife its distinctive look. Ergonomic handle;The handle is made out of pakka wood laminate in light brown color. It is quite large in comparison to handles on other chef knives and thus enables a firm grip. It is suitable for both right- and left-handed users. We especially recommend this type of handle to chefs with larger hands who usually struggle to find a suitable and comfortable chef's knife. HALOYIVGO chef knives are therefore extremely durable, retain an edge for a very long time, and are easy to sharpen. They also combine timeless, simple design with ultimate sharpness. They have an elegant look without sacrificing high quality and efficiency. They are perfect for home-cooking enthusiasts and professional chefs who look for perfect balance and durability in their faithful kitchen assistant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6154iY5VfiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HALOYIVGO","source_asin":"B0BG4DCV9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG4DCV9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG4DCV9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":653288,"name":"Cocktail Smoker Kit by Owl Haze - Old Fashioned Chimney Design - Handcrafted Smoker Mixology Kit - 4 Wood Chips Flavors Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c3oK1VODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OWL HAZE - Premium Cocktail Smoker Kit Get ready to unleash a new way to enjoy your favorite cocktails (and snacks) with the OWL HAZE Premium Cocktail Smoker Kit. With every drink, you will enjoy both smoky and woody notes. It is the perfect fun and interactive addition to a charcuterie board or cocktail party whether it’s a family dinner or a cocktail party. This is your opportunity to allow your mind to wander with endless culinary possibilities. OWL HAZE has cultivated our reputation around the world for our exceptional skills in helping to make the tastiest drinks. With our re-engineered chimney and by using only the finest all-natural wood chips, to uphold our highest standards, you can now enjoy a multi-sensory experience with big flavor and little effort. Free your senses and savor the taste - Join us and become a true mixologist enthusiast! Effortlessly Craft And Enjoy Your Favorite Smoky Cocktails, Drinks, Cheese, And Nuts ∙ Premium Cocktail Smoker Kit ∙ The Tastiest Drinks ∙ The Perfect Gift ∙ Unique And Innovative ∙ Ideal For Both Drinks & Snacks ∙ Easy To Use For Beginners ∙ Simple And Convenient Design ∙ Fits All Cocktail Glass Sizes ∙ Double Mesh Strainer ∙ Wood Chips Included (Cherry, Walnut, Oak, And Apple) Instructions 1. Place Owl Haze Smoker On Top Of Your Glass 2. Add A Few Wood Chips Of Your Choice Inside The Strainer 3. Light Torch Away From Smoker 4. Direct Your Torch Into The Wood Chips And Smoke For 3-5 Seconds Tip: For A Stronger Smokey Taste, Smoke Your Ice or Glass Before Pouring Your Drink. What’s Included? 1. Sophisticated Gift Box 2. Cocktail Smoker 3. Double Mesh Strainer 4. Four Different Wood Chips (Cherry, Walnut, Oak, and Apple)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c3oK1VODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Owl Haze","source_asin":"B09N7FPNGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N7FPNGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N7FPNGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
