window.products.push({"id":653499,"name":"SUNTAI Round Toilet Brush Holder Stainless Steel 304 Bathroom Accessory Standing for Bathroom(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hmN5XLJBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Unique Design:Upgraded from classical plastic toilet brush, we created the premium 304 stainless steel toilet brush. The material increases toilet brushs’-weight to help standing firmly.The ergonomic toilet brush is professionally designed for your bathroom, which makes your bathroom more tidy and elegant. Stain-Resistant & Efficient Brush:Black bristles made of the wear-resistant PP, Perfect Balance of Stiffness and Softness of the brush bristles for thorough and forceful cleaning even for hard to reach places.Its cleaning brush head will not damage your toilet and tiles and will not deform. 304 Stainless Steel Handle: Sturdy, Comfort Grip Handle,made of stainless steel,hollow inside, light in weight.The design of the ergonomic handle is perfectly suited to the shape of the hand and grip strength habit. Anti-Oder Design:The suspended design keeps the brush heads dry, while the sealed toilet brush and holder prevent odors in the bathroom, keeps floors clean and dry.The round baffle design protects your hands from stains and odors, you can use it with complete confidence. Easy to Assemble: Just screw the brush head into the bottom handle and screw the round cover in the middle of handle.No tools require.Easy Care:Clean with damp cloth. Space-saving:This durable toilet brush's caddy neatly stores the toilet brush, keeping it hygienic and discreetly hidden when not in use. Perfect for half and full baths, guest bathrooms, powder rooms.The perfect sanitary storage that is resistant to wear, stains and odors and will definitely promote comfortable cleanliness at home. Hassel Free Purchase :Backed by an SUNTAI limited 1-year warranty.Note: If there is detergent residue on the toilet brush, it is recommended to clean it and put it back into the toilet brush holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hmN5XLJBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNTAI","source_asin":"B0962SRHM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0962SRHM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0962SRHM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
