window.products.push({"id":653535,"name":"Fitpacker DUO USA Quality Meal Prep Containers 16-Pack 2 Compartment Bento Lunch Boxes with Lids - Portion Control & Food Storage Containers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MN8+1CLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meal Prep is the best way to lose weight, track your diet, control your portions and build muscle. Fitpacker is the choice of body builders, anyone on a diet plan that requires meal prep, and those of us with a busy schedule that wants to eat a healthy and balanced lifestyle. The key to reaching your fitness goals: The Fitpacker. Probably like most meal prep'ers, you have tried all the other containers and you can pick something wrong with every one of them. Glass is heavy and breaks, plastic stains and warps.This one takes too much space and that one costs too much. Here is a solution to making meal prep easy, efficient and affordable. These containers are easy to clean in a dishwasher (top shelf), store in a fridge, freezer or cabinet, and heat up great in a microwave. The 28 ounce size is the perfect starter to portioning your meals. These containers, a food scale and some measuring tools are all you need to take that next step to meal management. Dimensions: 8.75\" x 6\" x 1.5\"Temperature Guide - Hot - up to 250 degrees Fahrenheit/ 121 degrees Celcius - Cold - low as 0 degrees Fahrenheit/ -18 degrees Celcius The airtight seal helps keep cold items cold and hot items hot. The lid is designed raised so that it allows more storage space while it can also be placed under the Fitpacker almost like a tray. Fitpackers are perfect for: IIFYM Diet - If it fits your macros, 30 day meal challenge, Bulking & cutting for bodybuilding, Paleo dieters, Meal planning for diabetes or other health issues, Pregnancy meal preparation or any diet plan. Control your diet, control your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MN8+1CLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fitpacker","source_asin":"B0194MFCC0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194MFCC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194MFCC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
