window.products.push({"id":653556,"name":"BIRGILT Daughter Gifts - Inspirational Gifts for Girl Women - Funny Encouragement Birthday Gifts for Daughter, Teen Girl, Friend, Her - Daughter Tumbl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LoR3Gq-uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspirational Gift for All Girl Women - with the funny message print on the front to remind people do not to forget how awesome they are. Your girlfriend, best friend, family & colleagues can feel your appreciation and encouragement no matter at the home, office, driving, or traveling when they received the gifts. Unique Teen Girl Gifts - It is a simple friend and family tumbler but with full all the meaning, all of the heart. What a great gift for yourself, your best friend, daughter, sister, niece, cousin, girlfriend, and your family! Tumbler for teen girls.Inspirational tumbler for women. Stay Hot or Stay Cold - The high-quality stainless steel and the double-walled insulation design ensures beverage can stay either hot or cold over time. which can help maintain the temperature of your drink for a long time and protects your hands against the temperature when you choose our tumbler. Unique Lids - Features two unique lids to choose from when enjoying your beverage. New Slider Lid is fast and simple to use. It was inspired by the millions of coffee drinkers that enjoy sipping on their drinks quickly.The Slider Lid helps prevent splashing and spilling which allows you to enjoy your drink safely. Premium Material & BPA Free – These tumblers also come with a convenient reusable drink straw, straw cleaning brush, and BPA-free drink lid. Crafted with 18/8 food-grade stainless steel these tumblers are durable, Gently fits into your hand with an Anti-Sweat design. The 12 oz tumbler lightweight and compact feel make it easy to fit into most car cup holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LoR3Gq-uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIRGILT","source_asin":"B08G167X35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G167X35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G167X35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":653557,"name":"Set of 4 Table Mats- Funky and Modern Rustic Dining Words - 4 Place Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Rg7zYXA1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 100 % Jute Placemats- Eat, Drink, Enjoy, Dine. Simple. Beautiful. Create your own work of art, or use them for everyday placemats. Great gift! The kitchen table is the focal point of our homes. Try our 100% Jute Placemats in your home today! Someone once said, “Natural fiber has become the jeans of home décor.” You can dress them up, dress them down and layer them. They are affordable, and ever since they showed up in American homes we find them in more and more of our rooms. Jute: Jute is a plant fiber grown in Bangladesh, India and China. It is a bast fiber, meaning that the fibers come from the stem of the plant. Jute linens have a rich texture and a natural tonal variation that is durable yet soft. Today’s variety of more durable, softer, natural-fiber home fabrics provides new decorating ideas and a new twist to that shabby chic look for coastal or country homes. Place Mat Tips:Placemats are also called tablemats. Table cloths cover the complete table and may appear like a blanket on the table, placemats let you show off your mahogany or stylish table and create an intricate pattern by giving you the table surface as a blank canvas. Tablemats define the area for an individual at the table. The size of the table determines the number of placemats required. Pointers for placemats : Placemats are available in different shapes. Break the monotony of the round table with a rectangular placemat. Rectangular or square tables look sophisticated with rectangular tablemats. You can place the placemats directly on the table surface or on the tablecloth. In either case, the placemat must contrast the base. For plain surface, use our textured 100 % Jute placemats. Using 100 % jute placemats is a better choice as they can be easily washed and cleaned. Have a fun time decorating and remember it is your space, make it fun, funky and YOU!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Rg7zYXA1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marlo Lorenz","source_asin":"B015TJ16GI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015TJ16GI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015TJ16GI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
