window.products.push({"id":653624,"name":"Real Flower Reed Diffuser Set of 3 for Bathroom Air Fresheners, Gift Oil Diffuser Sticks | Gardenia Jasmine Bergamot & Neroli Scent(1.7 fl oz Each Pac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EOvnW7BHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium and unique scent: Gardenia's fragrance is fresh and light, It is not as strong as other floral scents, but a sudden waft of a Chan fragrance will make you feel instantly relaxed, suitable for use in all seasons because you will never feel stuffy, it is always just right... Jasmine perfume is mixed with a tiny bitter scent of cedar, which will definitely have a very good effect when you put a bottle next to it in a place where you really need a pick-me-up, such as a conference room or a study... The scent of Neroli and bergamot is light, breezy and can be energizing, and its scent wafts through like a cool breeze. Natural: Gentle and long-lasting aromatherapy are made from a combination of natural plant essential oils and organic solutions, alcohol-free, Whether it's a home, office or hotel you can use collection with confidence. Long-lasting: high concentration of essential oils with high-performance diffusion stick, the longest you can make your room fragrance 30 days each bottle (2-4 fiber stick is recommended) Gift: If you are tired of traditional gifts, reed diffusers must be the perfect and creative gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Birthdays, Relocation Package Contents: 3 bottles of high quality liquid aromatherapy, 30 sticks (18 natural rattan sticks(6 of them are inserted in the flowers, rattan sticks dark and light colors randomly), plus if you prefer a larger scent here is a gift of 12 black fiber sticks, which diffuse better than rattan sticks), 6 decorative flowers, and 1 luxurious and beautiful box. After-sales: You can contact us with any questions, we will solve all the problems you encounter as quickly as possible!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EOvnW7BHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEALD TRIBE","source_asin":"B0BNQQTDF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-653624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQQTDF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQQTDF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
